# The File Organizer verifies its own files byte-for-byte against
# SOURCE_SHA256.csv on every launch (Test-Installation.ps1). That manifest is
# computed on LF-terminated files, so every checkout MUST be LF on every
# platform -- otherwise a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would smudge
# the text files to CRLF and fail its own integrity check.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.zip binary
